(
    title: "Adventure",
    developer: Some("Warren Robinett"),
    description: Some("The player guides a square avatar through a connected world of thirty rooms, hunting a magical chalice and carrying it back to the Golden Castle. Three dragons roam the map and a bat flits about swapping items from place to place, including whatever the player is holding. Keys open the castles, and a sword is the only defence against the dragons."),
